From dd6e4492fa5e7a23aafc0fee9918b8c3f6274b4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qiyinxi <qiyinxi@foxmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 11:27:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 69/98] MAS local: add safe shutdown to the lean toolbar

Keep only minimize, close, back and home in the default side toolbar. Route lean-toolbar close requests through the guest shutdown command, sync fallback and bounded forced-exit path, while preserving the full toolbar behavior.

Change-Id: I7b4e9c2a1d5f6b8c0e3a9d7f4b2c6e8a1d0f3c5b
